	)
	(text "Fan and pump: LEDC PWM at 25 kHz through a BSS138, because the PWM input can sit at 5.25 V (Intel 4-wire spec) and GPIOs are not 5 V tolerant. GPIO high = FET on = 0% drive; firmware inverts the duty."
